            "text": "<ul><li><strong>Convenient On-Site Service</strong>: We come directly to your facility, minimizing employee downtime.</li><li><strong>Customized Selection</strong>: Every visit is stocked specifically for your workforce and safety requirements.</li><li><strong>Top Footwear Brands</strong>: Shop trusted names like Carolina, Timberland PRO, LaCrosse, Reebok Work, Thorogood, and more.</li><li><strong>Footwear for Every Job</strong>: Choose from steel toe, composite toe, metatarsal, pull-on, hikers, athletic styles, and more for both men and women.</li><li><strong>Expert Boot Fittings</strong>: Our knowledgeable team helps employees find the right fit, comfort, and protection before they buy.</li><li><strong>Flexible Payment Options</strong>: We accept corporate invoicing, vouchers, cash, credit cards, or a combination of payment methods.</li></ul>",
